        "answer": {
          "short": "56 cents.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}E(X)&=\\sum xP(X=x)\\\\&=0\\left(\\frac23\\right)+1\\left(\\frac16\\right)+2\\left(\\frac19\\right)+3\\left(\\frac1{18}\\right)\\\\&=\\frac59\\text{ dollars}\\\\&\\approx\\$0.56\\end{align*}$$",
